    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;5;-544,96;Inherit;False;1;0;FLOAT;0;False;1;FLOAT;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.FunctionInput,
